.SH MAN PAGE GENERATION PIPELINE
Man pages can be generated from silkpage sidebar metadata governed by Collibra
Four Letter Codes (FLCs) from the 1\-year mandate contract
.IR c.contract.man\-pipeline\-1yr .
.PP
The pipeline has three phases:
.TP
.B singine man seed [\-\-silkpage\-root DIR] [\-\-db PATH]
Parse silkpage XML files from
.I DIR
(default: sibling
.IR silkpage/templates/site/default/src/xml/en )
and populate
.I sidebar_entries
+
.I flc_assets
in the SQLite database.
.TP
.B singine man generate [\-\-page ID|all] [\-\-db PATH] [\-\-out\-dir DIR]
Look up sidebar entries from the DB and produce roff
.B .1
man pages under
.IR man/ .
Each page is tagged with FLC code
.B MANP
and linked to DW dimensions.
.TP
.B singine man migrate [\-\-db PATH] [\-\-pg\-url URL]
Emit PostgreSQL
.B INSERT
statements from the SQLite DB.
Pipe to
.B psql
to complete the SQLite \(-> PostgreSQL migration.
.PP
FLC asset operations:
.TP
.B singine man flc \-\-flc\-cmd list [\-\-db PATH]
List all Collibra Four Letter Code assets and their mandate dates.
.TP
.B singine man flc \-\-flc\-cmd show \-\-flc\-code MANP [\-\-db PATH]
Show details and DW dimension mapping for a single FLC code.
.PP
Community\-active data citizen registration:
.TP
.B singine man citizen \-\-citizen\-id ID \-\-citizen\-label LABEL [\-\-db PATH]
Register a public data citizen bound by the FLC mandate.
.SH FLC CODES (1\-YEAR MANDATE)
The following Collibra Four Letter Codes are defined in
.I man/flc_manifest.json
and seeded into the database at
.B seed
time:
.TP
.B MANP
Man Page \(em generated roff publication asset
.TP
.B SIDM
Sidebar Metadata \(em silkpage XML nav entry + page head
.TP
.B CNTB
Content Block \(em silkpage XML section element
.TP
.B DCTZ
Data Citizen \(em community\-active public identity
.TP
.B MIGR
Migration Service \(em Mule \(-> Spring Boot record
.TP
.B GOVC
Governance Contract \(em 1\-year mandate in Collibra
.TP
.B DIMN
DW Dimension \(em data warehouse axis mapping
.TP
.B SNGE
Singine Execution \(em runtime command audit entry
.TP
.B SILP
Silkpage Asset \(em HTML publication page
.TP
.B MULE
Mule Service \(em ESB endpoint (migration source)
.TP
.B SPBT
Spring Boot Service \(em microservice (migration target)
.SH DATABASE SCHEMA
The SQLite schema is defined in
.I man/db/V004__man_pages.sql
and the PostgreSQL target in
.IR man/db/V004__man_pages_pg.sql .
Tables:
.B flc_assets,
.B dw_dimensions,
.B sidebar_entries,
.B man_pages,
.B data_citizens,
.B man_page_citizens,
.B migration_services.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
# Top-level index (start here).
singine man

# Generate man pages from silkpage sidebar metadata:
singine man seed --silkpage-root ../silkpage/templates/site/default/src/xml/en
singine man generate --page all
singine man generate --page cleanup --out-dir man/

# Seed and generate in one step:
make -C man all

# List FLC codes and mandates:
singine man flc --flc-cmd list

# Show DW dimension mapping for MANP:
singine man flc --flc-cmd show --flc-code MANP

# Register a data citizen:
singine man citizen --citizen-id dctz-jhe-001 --citizen-label "Jay H" --community sindoc

# Migrate SQLite → PostgreSQL:
singine man migrate --pg-url postgresql://localhost:5432/singine | psql $PG_URL

# AI conversation data — listing, inspection, export, centralisation.
singine man singine-ai

# Semantic bridge and SPARQL queries over AI session data.
singine man singine-bridge

# Policy governance for Claude, Codex, and OpenAI.
singine man singine-policy

# Governance decision records (online and offline).
singine man singine-decide

# Runtime, context, and execution envelope.
singine man singine-runtime
singine man singine-context
singine man singine-server
singine man singine-logseq
singine man singine-snapshot

# Template generation for Maven and npm.
singine man singine-template
singine man singine-archetype
singine man singine-dotfiles
singine man singine-intranet

# Demo bundles and platform scaffold.
singine man singine-demo
singine man singine-platform
singine man singine-essay

# Activity taxonomy and DP(DP).
singine man singine-activity

# Apple Photos review workflow and test-case commands.
singine man singine-photo

# Get the raw filesystem path to a manpage.
singine man singine-auth --raw
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I man/generate_man.py
