.TP
.I man/db/V004__man_pages.sql
SQLite DDL (V004 migration)
.TP
.I man/db/V004__man_pages_pg.sql
PostgreSQL DDL (migration target)
.TP
.I singine/man_gen.py
Python module wired into singine CLI for man generate/seed/migrate commands
